sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant WE as Workflow / Simulation Execution
    participant Policy as PolicyEngine
    participant PE as PromptEngine
    participant KE as KnowledgeEngine
    participant IE as IntelligenceEngine
    participant EE as EvaluationEngine
    participant TE as TraceEngine
    participant PA as PlatformAnalytics

    Client->>WE: Start Execution
    WE->>TE: TraceStartedEvent
    WE->>WE: ExecutionStartedEvent

    WE->>KE: Retrieve Knowledge Package
    KE->>TE: KnowledgeRetrievedEvent
    KE-->>WE: Sealed KnowledgePackage

    WE->>PE: Render Prompt (Template + Knowledge)
    PE->>TE: PromptRenderedEvent
    PE-->>WE: Rendered Prompt

    WE->>Policy: Evaluate Guardrails
    Policy->>TE: PolicyEvaluatedEvent
    Policy-->>WE: PolicyDecision (Allowed / Denied)

    alt Execution Permitted
        WE->>IE: Plan & Execute (Provider / Model)
        IE->>TE: IntelligenceExecutionCompletedEvent
        IE-->>WE: Normalized Execution Result (Tokens, ZAR Cost)

        WE->>EE: Evaluate Response (Scorecard)
        EE->>TE: EvaluationCompletedEvent
        EE-->>WE: Scorecard Verdict

        WE->>PA: Emit Safe Analytics Event (Tokens, Duration, Cost ZAR)
        WE->>TE: TraceCompletedEvent
        WE->>WE: ExecutionCompletedEvent
        WE-->>Client: Return Result
    else Execution Denied
        WE->>PA: Emit Policy Prevented Analytics Event
        WE->>TE: TraceCompletedEvent (Failed)
        WE->>WE: ExecutionFailedEvent
        WE-->>Client: Policy Denied Error
    end
